<title>USA: CV Therapeutics cuts back IPO.</title>
<headline>CV Therapeutics cuts back IPO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>CV Therapeutics Inc has trimmed the estimated price to buy shares in its proposed initial public offering, according to underwriter JP Morgan.</p>
<p>The Palo Alto, California company plans to offer 2.5 million shares in a range of $8 to $9 each. It had previously planned to offer shares in a range of $12 to $14.</p>
<p>The biopharmaceutical company uses molecular cardiology to treat chronic cardiovascular disease.</p>
<p>The offering could price this evening for trading tomorrow.</p>
</text>
